<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Hypotekbanken issues new four pct bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Hypotekbanken issues new four pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced in a statement sent to Copenhagen Stock Exchange by arranger Gudme Raaschou and lead manager Jyske Bank on Monday.</p>
<p>BORROWER HYPOTEKBANKEN</p>
<p>AMT 100 MLN DKK</p>
<p>COUPON 4.00</p>
<p>MATURITY 8 YEARS</p>
<p>TYPE STRAIGHT</p>
<p>ISS PRICE UNDISC</p>
<p>DATE 17 FEB. 1997 --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
